Hi Neo,

I hope things are going well at Lekker Bakes.

This is our October 2026 edition of the Swartland Print customer newsletter with a quick update from our studio.

Product news: We have added a new range of recycled kraft boxes and paper bags for bakeries and takeaways, plus refreshed options for menu cards, stickers and thank you cards. Samples are available in store for you to have a look at when you visit.

Seasonal tip: With summer on the way, many of our customers are updating their gift packaging and year end labels early while we are still quiet. It is a good time to check your stock and plan ahead.

Thank you for supporting our small business.

Kind regards
